---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Process" description="How Wellridge Partners qualifies, scopes, controls, and closes funding and program operations engagements.">
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-fog">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-serif font-bold text-slate-deep mb-6">Our Process</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
        A disciplined path from opportunity assessment to accepted delivery and closeout.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-8">
        Funding and program work becomes risky when ownership, inputs, approvals, and deadlines are unclear. Our six-step control loop makes those decisions visible from the start and keeps each engagement tied to a bounded statement of work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-fog">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-ridge-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold">
              1
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-3">Qualify</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                We clarify the buyer, need, funding or budget path, timing, scope fit, available evidence, internal capacity, data requirements, partner needs, and next decision.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>Output:</strong> Qualification brief with fit, risks, dependencies, and next action
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-ridge-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold">
              2
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-3">Decide</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                We use a documented go/no-go review to test alignment, feasibility, compliance burden, available inputs, role clarity, and delivery capacity before committing resources.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>Output:</strong> Go/no-go decision with assumptions, exclusions, and decision owner
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-ridge-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold">
              3
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-3">Scope</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                We define deliverables, responsibilities, client and partner inputs, dates, meetings, revision cycles, data, acceptance criteria, payment milestones, and change control in writing.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>Output:</strong> Bounded statement of work and milestone plan
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-ridge-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold">
              4
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-3">Launch & Control</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                At kickoff, we confirm the source of truth, decision-makers, communication path, risks, and dependency owners. Delivery is then managed through a single calendar, action register, evidence file, compliance matrix, and version owner.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>Output:</strong> Active control plan, input tracker, and current delivery record
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 5 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-ridge-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold">
              5
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-3">Review & Deliver</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                Work moves through production checks, specialist review where required, Wellridge final quality review, and client approval. Facts, calculations, claims, and final external submissions always require human review.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>Output:</strong> Approved deliverable, acceptance record, and milestone completion
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 6 -->
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-ridge-blue text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-2xl font-bold">
              6
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold mb-3">Close & Extend</h2>
              <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
                We close the engagement with records, unresolved items, lessons learned, and the agreed reporting or closeout structure. If further support is useful, it is defined as a separate task or scope amendment.
              </p>
              <p class="text-gray-700">
                <strong>Output:</strong> Closeout record, next-step recommendation, and reusable operating tools
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">The Control Tools</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
        The exact toolkit changes with the scope, but the operating principles remain consistent:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li><strong>Qualification Briefs:</strong> Make fit, dependencies, and risk visible</li>
        <li><strong>Go/No-Go Records:</strong> Document decisions, assumptions, and exclusions</li>
        <li><strong>Compliance Matrices:</strong> Translate requirements into owned actions</li>
        <li><strong>Master Calendars & Input Trackers:</strong> Keep milestones and dependencies current</li>
        <li><strong>QA & Approval Records:</strong> Preserve review, acceptance, and closeout evidence</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mt-6">
        Selected planning tools are available in our <a href="/resources" class="text-ridge-blue hover:underline">Resources</a> section.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-deep text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">Prepare for Fit and Scope</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 mb-8">
        Use the scope-preparation checklist to record what is moving, what is stuck, and what responsibility a partner may need to own.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-ridge-blue text-white rounded-md text-lg font-medium hover:bg-opacity-90 transition-colors"
      >
        Prepare a Scope
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
